<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA A SCORE 292 FOR SEVEN V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA A SCORE 292 FOR SEVEN V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia A scored 292 for seven in 50 overs in their limited-overs match against Pakistan on Saturday.</p>
<p>Score - Australia A 292 for seven (Stuart Law 76, Darren Lehmann 69).</p>
